cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: Dempster-Shafer library
abstract: >-
  A header-only C++17 library implementing core Dempster–Shafer evidential
  theory: frames of discernment, generic mass functions (BPA), belief/plausibility/
  commonality, and combination rules (conjunctive, disjunctive, Dempster, Yager).
authors:
